Model weights
-------------
The weights are not stored in this repository. `cargo run -p lightvc-xtask -- package`
copies three exported parts into models/ of the distribution:

  - models/pfront_export — front end v3 (signal processing only).
    Holds a fixed mel filterbank and a DCT matrix. It has no learned weights
    and no training data.

  - models/p_model_export — performance encoder E and circuit C
    (checkpoint snv_p11_r, step 20000).
    Trained only on speech generated with Irodori-TTS-v4.1-Small (Aratako; MIT):
    564 fictional voices (VoiceDesign, made from text descriptions; no recording
    of a real person was used as a voice reference), 10 utterances per voice,
    plus non-verbal vocalizations by the same voices.
    The sentences were taken from the transcripts of a non-public speech dataset,
    which is not distributed.

  - models/rvoc3hi — vocoder rvoc3hi (step 330000). Trained on:
      - a non-public dataset of real speech, which is not distributed;
      - speech generated with Irodori-TTS-600M-v3-VoiceDesign (Aratako; MIT)
        using clips of that dataset as voice references.

